  "historyNote": "#5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8988, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9539, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10626, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13688, eff 7-19-23",
